---
// Quiz figure for the Backtest post: PurgeStrip. Inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids.
---
<div class="qfig-atq12-purgestrip">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 164" role="img" aria-label="A row of days with a test block starting at day 1,000. The 20 training days from 980 to 999 are shaded; the label of day 990 covers days 991 to 1,010, so it reaches into the test block.">
<text x="10" y="20" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Around a test block that starts at day 1,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Quanh một khối kiểm tra bắt đầu ở ngày 1.000</tspan></text>
<rect x="30.0" y="50" width="208.0" height="34" rx="6" class="box" />
<text x="134.0" y="72" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>train</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>huấn luyện</tspan></text>
<rect x="238.0" y="50" width="52.0" height="34" rx="6" class="badb" />
<rect x="290.0" y="50" width="260.0" height="34" rx="6" class="okb" />
<text x="420.0" y="72" class="t13 b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>test block</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>khối kiểm tra</tspan></text>
<text x="238.0" y="44" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>980</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>980</tspan></text>
<text x="290.0" y="44" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1.000</tspan></text>
<path d="M 264.0 96 L 264.0 104 L 316.0 104 L 316.0 96" class="redl" />
<text x="290.0" y="126" class="t13" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>the label of day 990 covers days 991 to 1,010</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nhãn của ngày 990 phủ các ngày 991 tới 1.010</tspan></text>
<text x="264.0" y="148" class="t13 redt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>20 training days (980 to 999) reach into the test block</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>20 ngày huấn luyện (980 tới 999) chạm vào khối kiểm tra</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip svg { display: block; width: 100%;  height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .t13 { font-size: 13px; }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip .hole { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-atq12-purgestrip figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
